      "id": "ea6da0f09967-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "In &Delta;ABC, D is the mid‐point of BC and G is the centroid. If GD = 10 cm, then the length of AD is _________.",
      "questionHtml": "In &Delta;ABC, D is the mid‐point of BC and G is the centroid. If GD = 10 cm, then the length of AD is _________.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "20 cm",
          "html": "20 cm"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "10 cm",
          "html": "10 cm"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "15 cm",
          "html": "15 cm"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "30 cm",
          "html": "30 cm"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "Given: GD = 10 cm\n<p> </p>\nGD = (1/3) * AD\n\n<p> </p>\n10 = (1/3) * AD\n\n<p> </p>\nAD = 10 × 3\n\n<p> </p>\nAD = 30 cm",
