    {
      "id": "ea6da0f09967-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "In the given figure, in &Delta; PQR, PQ = 8 cm, &ang;P = 90&deg; and median PS is perpendicular to median QT at X. What is the length of QT?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>In the given figure, in&nbsp;&Delta; PQR, PQ = 8 cm, &ang;P = 90&deg; and median PS is perpendicular to median QT at X. What is the length of QT?&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6836b0b1e2f4cd7195c4a0e0.png\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "6&radic;6 cm",
          "html": "6&radic;6 cm"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "8&radic;3 cm",
          "html": "8&radic;3 cm"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4&radic;6 cm",
          "html": "4&radic;6 cm"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "6&radic;3 cm",
          "html": "6&radic;3 cm"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>In the given figure, in &Delta; PQR, PQ = 8 cm, &ang;P = 90&deg; and median PS is perpendicular to median QT at X.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>When two medians&nbsp;intersect at a point called the &quot;centroid&quot; which divides each median in a ratio of 2:1.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6836b510458dfc628e10f254.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>When two medians intersect at a point called the &quot;centroid&quot; which divides each median in a ratio of 2:1.</p>\n\n<p>So, PX : XS = 2a : a</p>\n\n<p>QX : XT = 2b : b</p>\n\n<p>Now, using Pythagoras theorem</p>\n\n<p><strong>In &Delta;&nbsp;PQX,</strong></p>\n\n<p>PX<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ QX<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= PQ<sup>2</sup></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; (2a)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ (2b)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 8<sup>2</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>4a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 4b<sup>2</sup> = 64&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;--- (1)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">In &Delta;&nbsp;PXT,</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">PX<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ XT<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;= PT<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; (2a)<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;=&nbsp;PT<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 4a</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;=&nbsp;PT</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; ---- (2)</p>\n\n<p><strong>In </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&Delta;</span><strong>&nbsp;PQT,</strong></p>\n\n<p>QT<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>= PQ<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ PT<sup>2</sup></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; QT<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 8<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 4a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; (2b + b)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 64 + (64 - 4b<sup>2</sup></span>)<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp; &nbsp;(from equation (1))</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; (3b)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 64 + 64 - 4b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 9b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 128 - 3b<sup>2</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;12b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 128</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; b<sup>2&nbsp;</sup></span>= 128/12 = 32/3</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; b =&nbsp;&radic;(32/3) =&nbsp;&radic;(32&nbsp;&times; 3)/ (3&nbsp;&times; 3) =&nbsp;&radic;(96/9) =&nbsp;&radic;96 / 3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, QT = 3b = 3&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;&radic;96 / 3 =&nbsp;&radic;96 = 4&radic;6 cm</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Therefore, the correct answer is option (3).</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6836b0b1e2f4cd7195c4a0e0.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6836b510458dfc628e10f254.png"
