      "id": "ea6da0f09967-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "A right angle triange XYZ is right angle at Y and XY = 40 cm and XZ = 41 cm.What is the ratio of the circumradius and inradius of the triangle?",
      "questionHtml": "A right angle triange XYZ is right angle at Y and XY = 40 cm and XZ = 41 cm.What is the ratio of the circumradius and inradius of the triangle?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "20 : 9",
          "html": "20 : 9&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "41 : 8",
          "html": "41 : 8"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "41 : 9",
          "html": "41 : 9"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5 : 1",
          "html": "5 : 1"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>XYZ is a right-angle triangle.</p>\n\n<p>XY = 40&nbsp;cm, XZ = 41&nbsp;cm.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>(XZ)<sup>2</sup> = XY<sup>2</sup> + YZ<sup>2</sup></p>\n\n<p>Inradius of&nbsp; right angle triangle XYZ&nbsp; = (XY + YZ &ndash; XZ) / 2</p>\n\n<p>Circum radius of&nbsp; right angle triangle XYZ = XZ / 2</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/11/F4_Savita_SSC_22-11-22_D13.png\" style=\" width: 227px; height: 198px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>So,</p>\n\n<p>(41)<sup>2</sup> = 40<sup>2</sup> + YZ<sup>2</sup></p>\n\n<p>YZ<sup>2</sup>= 1681 - 1600</p>\n\n<p>YZ<sup>2 </sup>= 81</p>\n\n<p>YZ = 9 cm</p>\n\n<p>Inradius of&nbsp; right angle triangle XYZ&nbsp; = (40&nbsp;+ 9&nbsp;&ndash; 41) / 2</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 8 / 2 = 4</p>\n\n<p>Circum radius of&nbsp; right angle triangle XYZ = XZ / 2</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>41/ 2 = 20.5</p>\n\n<p>So, the ratio = 20.5 : 4</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>41 : 8</p>\n\n<p><strong>The ratio of the circumradius and inradius of the triangle = 41:8</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/11/F4_Savita_SSC_22-11-22_D13.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
