      "id": "ea6da0f09967-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "In &Delta; ABC, &ang;A = 80&deg;, &ang;B = 70&deg; and the incentre of the triangle is at P. Find the value of &ang;BPC.",
      "questionHtml": "In &Delta; ABC, &ang;A = 80&deg;, &ang;B = 70&deg; and the incentre of the triangle is at P. Find the value of &ang;BPC.<span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "145&deg;",
          "html": "145&deg;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "120&deg;",
          "html": "120&deg;"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "130&deg;",
          "html": "130&deg;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "150&deg;",
          "html": "150&deg;"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given;</strong></p>\n\n<p>In &Delta; ABC, &ang;A = 80&deg;, &ang;B = 70&deg;, and the incentre of the triangle is at P.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F2_Vinanti_State%20govt._19.07.23_D2.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 144px; height: 146px;\" /><br />\nIncentre is the intersecting point of internal angle bisectors. And P is the incentre of &Delta;ABC,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&ang;BIC = 90&deg; + &ang;A/2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">In &Delta;ABC,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&ang;BPC = 90&deg; + &ang;A/2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; [P is incentre of &Delta;ABC]</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; &ang;BPC = 90&deg; + 80&deg;/2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; &ang;BPC = 130&deg;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>&there4;&nbsp;The correct answer is option C. 130&deg;. (Note: The value should be positive, not negative.)</strong></p>\n",
